300
00:24:34.890 --> 00:24:36.850
At ngayon lang naging exciting.

301
00:24:36.933 --> 00:24:39.227
Gayunpaman, sinasabi nila na kung ang hari
nakakaligtaan ang ritwal,

302
00:24:39.311 --> 00:24:40.687
