432
00:33:32.051 --> 00:33:33.469
Ay naku.

433
00:33:34.053 --> 00:33:35.888
Mayroon kang espada, ha?

434
00:33:36.472 --> 00:33:40.268
Hindi ko alam kung saang administrative office
